## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates understanding of consent-driven data minimization, offline safety, and the relationship between consent lifecycle and CCA score calculation.

## Key Concepts
- Consent tokens gate data exposure
- policy_version controls exposure granularity
- Idempotent, offline-safe compute operations
- Per-user data retention settings

## Code Example
```javascript
async function computeCCA(userIdMasked, consentToken, policyVersion) {
  const consent = await consentStore.validate(consentToken, policyVersion);
  if (!consent?.allowed) {
    throw new Error('Not authorized');
  }
  const score = await calculateScore(userIdMasked, consent);
  return { user_id_masked: userIdMasked, cca_score: score };
}
```

